WORLD MAP (public/world/countries-50m.json, made by scripts/build-world-map.ts)
  Coastlines, country borders and lakes from Natural Earth, 1:50m scale (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/), in the
  public domain; "Crediting the authors is unnecessary", and the map says "Made with Natural Earth" anyway. The
  country names and borders are Natural Earth's own. The file is made from the downloaded data by thinning the lines.

I CHING, GEOMANCY AND BIBLIOMANCY (lib/iching-data.ts, lib/geomancy-data.ts, lib/bibliomancy-core.ts)
  The structure of the systems (the numbers and names of the 64 hexagrams, the 16 geomantic figures and the way a
  chart is made) is traditional and is set out in the sources listed in lib/sources.ts. No translation of the I
  Ching's texts is included; James Legge's of 1882 is in the public domain and is linked from the Sources pages.

